The dish is a white paper plate, about 20 cm across (a side plate). It holds roughly 11 slices of browned sausage, probably smoked sausage or kielbasa. Each slice is about 4 cm across and 1.5 cm thick, so it weighs about 15-20 g.

That puts the total at about 11 × 17 ≈ 190 g. Smoked sausage runs about 300 kcal per 100 g, so 190 g comes to roughly 550 kcal. The slices may be a bit smaller than I estimated, so I'll shade the weight down to about 180 g and the energy to about 540 kcal.

